    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6242067c561db439d479119e",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "正在寻找头脑灵活的赛马娘。",
      "source_fingerprint": "82ac30cfac8a79350d00acca1cdcb50176d61c406a9286dd69d2c93fcf4df66e",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "216",
        "1012"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:29b9459d9324f21667462bf9",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "正在寻找擅长在终盘发挥瞬间爆发力的赛马娘！\\n我很期待您的才干。",
      "source_fingerprint": "51ece832169811d42f0d58e3d06bc1c9bcb64544cbbacced8704e48f856d91f8",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "216",
        "11001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a5109bbefe5f896abcd1c9d1",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "能够展现出疾风般的奔跑……\\n希望这样的赛马娘一定要加入我的队伍。",
      "source_fingerprint": "9d53cfec99f96dd6168e0c027d40672f2c65b86f326c228a91587f1f93a168f1",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "216",
        "11002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f6f9babb42255da4b3fce0bf",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "正在寻找对根性有自信的赛马娘。",
      "source_fingerprint": "6c0c68f7e0abf912cabb7baf21a73cc5cf34ff740032600f055a56163e83eabc",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "216",
        "11003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2a450ed078db9a4caac308b8",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "正在寻找富有耐力的赛马娘。",
      "source_fingerprint": "4f9e7339401b6f932bd85155f3c86ea5e650ccee1768f7119e25f208c2fe8347",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "216",
        "11004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0feb895addc353f9ef8c87c1",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "正在寻找富有速度的赛马娘。",
      "source_fingerprint": "9768a92b37e4dfa6833f7bb1e2cd69f0e0ca5dbc54cb970ec0f7e0fcd549091f",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "216",
        "11005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:eafd3e3f8fcdca377fd95e8f",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "正在寻找富有力量的赛马娘。",
      "source_fingerprint": "74662259e4c5b4b133c949d818c3565ee47b0ba765f68ff8c08dd9819aced5bc",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "216",
        "11006"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8137f791b1dcde67af787d90",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "我所寻求的，是兼备速度和力量的赛马娘。\\n……拜托了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "7da8db42d1b0bfcf764a7c5d1d53fd576b5b1af28bd795ac1f5b0e1797c409c9",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "216",
        "12001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1527d4999b5de61551993f1c",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "正在招募能在比赛后半程向我们展现猛烈追赶的赛马娘！\\n请您务必向我介绍。",
      "source_fingerprint": "c52bb58a6692abf9aa02caa65e27cd1008a460fd40186554b51807333250cc02",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "216",
        "12002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:418f680ad7c21c3820865872",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "正在寻找对速度有自信的赛马娘。",
      "source_fingerprint": "69a4cd9b4f751f0d2d38a7b208dd36a5d0fbd3b513094a8cccbb1faf5343542d",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "216",
        "12003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:fcc275f8077ac038c0da3bd0",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "正在寻找对力量有自信的赛马娘。",
      "source_fingerprint": "c5c4e54536c462e3f05bfbb76983b68466fe37b1ce2aec0f1a82a26a3fb0e99f",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "216",
        "12004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:cb555cbc1a167be21f7e7c81",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "正在寻找不屈不挠的赛马娘。",
      "source_fingerprint": "29fb734f6c6714dab9f9da9318677b22e15463a92d395ba136d7ac8137c42a67",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "216",
        "12005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:49b94e8ac88faf9b6988477f",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "正在寻找头脑灵活的赛马娘。",
      "source_fingerprint": "82ac30cfac8a79350d00acca1cdcb50176d61c406a9286dd69d2c93fcf4df66e",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "216",
        "12006"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:cf98e8529112cc3b2a9b593e",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "我正在寻找能快到让我根本看不见影子的赛马娘。",
      "source_fingerprint": "4a174511b6e5b7b9d4f9adc0799f90b34f60ddd34bde01d636ba352c42616657",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "216",
        "13001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e5510fa1ce4c2982847eb467",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "我正在寻找能在无数比赛中表现出稳定跑法的赛马娘。",
      "source_fingerprint": "b11287ef586b179124fdb46f3cae88bf38ed5c6a77d585fdabf4ddcdf5865158",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "216",
        "13002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:51b008598bcafd8c800a32b9",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "你认识那种\\n孤傲地在比赛中上演华丽逃亡戏的帅气赛马娘吗？",
      "source_fingerprint": "57a04c73f9817aa7c79078ec921c4053df528054e6310592ed8b62137d45f19c",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "216",
        "13003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e01b4e302ec6dd5c8262311c",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "我正在寻找脑袋很灵光的赛马娘。\\n能请您为我介绍一个吗？",
      "source_fingerprint": "ce97cb9d9c1b89e45cf7fc12647aaeb2c9e3d02a6df4fad9425a6c992b0c2152",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "216",
        "13004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4d10e1f73e55ab197e086459",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "我正在寻找对自己耐力有自信的赛马娘。\\n能请您为我介绍一个吗？",
      "source_fingerprint": "3ec97eb4ab0f1c32daf65e84785428ce2acd0b09dbef882de23537968e00a3a7",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "216",
        "13005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ac3cf33d17c0f6fe0b76fc22",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "我正在寻找能让我感到“后无来者”的赛马娘。",
      "source_fingerprint": "d38c0f068f41d3bffcbeb43c2f85d40793cf31bbc0a8dde2413886f173730765",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "216",
        "13006"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:fd12d81fcea2508ee3163365",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "我正在寻找在中距离比赛中表现出众的赛马娘。",
      "source_fingerprint": "09dc8ac74029aec0ca29c93ce997e0502d326bd7f1042068ae2e72d0a3bc678e",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "216",
        "13007"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:30a17c2c1b4c83bb264fa30f",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "我正在寻找能在无数强豪中冲出重围的赛马娘。",
      "source_fingerprint": "90748676b2a02fc927224b879d01509bf94d1c451165da635cfc369336b75585",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "216",
        "13008"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:be04f6fb65df7998b8a9ec59",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "我正在寻找对力量有自信的赛马娘。\\n请您务必向我介绍一位。",
      "source_fingerprint": "e58e4599810b2287ae1b3c4ff6474ba5537b27848e825cd98823dd3bbdd243d8",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "216",
        "13009"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:345f2eecd20f8824794e2231",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "我在找对自己速度有自信的赛马娘哦！\\n能请您为我介绍一下吗？",
      "source_fingerprint": "0b78e53f3c1c7d0a4397f05a2d9149d9465d03fc1fcbdfbea596ace71ad40d11",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "216",
        "13010"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9cedda6624dca2c9bf48bd6c",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "我正在寻找达成了永不磨灭的伟业、\\n在赛场上绽放出华美花朵的赛马娘。",
      "source_fingerprint": "c8bdc2efd42a804c3cf921ff56f25cda0eb6623e91a22155dbdfa2dce17970b2",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "216",
        "13011"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6d8525bcd414206de6dacdef",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "你能为我介绍一位在强敌众多的大舞台中\\n也同样表现出众的赛马娘吗？",
      "source_fingerprint": "4e5468539f07e86873eb480a3ee29bd970abb67e599a4efda813ffa0d480d350",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "216",
        "13012"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7fa1415a7a1643c74c29aad4",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "我正在寻找为自己的奔跑而感到幸福，\\n让人情不自禁想为她加油的赛马娘。",
      "source_fingerprint": "6061324d213fb8537e0f1228c9ddc34e055eaf981d58215848a85236bccd09ef",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "216",
        "13013"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e93228c7c72932265da072aa",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "我在找对自己力量有自信的赛马娘……\\n……能请您介绍一下吗？",
      "source_fingerprint": "d1d7e1c16df43b711ac571c92ba812c27fa61a33245278e4649282510bfb1905",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "216",
        "13014"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f32c8f1069dacdda82401fde",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "我在找对根性有自信的赛马娘哦。\\n能请您为我介绍一位吗？",
      "source_fingerprint": "a9eb135606a94ffa4c42f7666731708be0d540983bb53bd928411d69b0694d96",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "216",
        "13015"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7f7c0a43185bf0fc70b50253",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "我正在寻找前进时绝不让出好位置的赛马娘！\\n期待您介绍马娘的本领！",
      "source_fingerprint": "bef11d63c93d9f9f6196d89bd9ce04adf4b68dda5310bf42ab1cbfb44e3feaf1",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "216",
        "14001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d85542cd4bb87ea40dae652a",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "要是……可以的话……\\n能请您为我介绍能在短距离比赛中发挥实力的赛马娘吗？",
      "source_fingerprint": "5d17406afd30adfc2f4b6360244cd747897c6938b5bb45cbf0ebf169a96f3fba",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "216",
        "14002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:52d89a54ce34041e364fd0d8",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "如疾风一般飞驰的赛马娘……\\n如果您认识的话，请务必让她来我的队伍。",
      "source_fingerprint": "ba40ad564bef4a848b88fd81374332bb6f33000e4b576bcb46621e287ee8838c",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "216",
